{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03119","headline":"奉和圣制登封礼毕洛城酺宴 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制登封礼毕洛城酺宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君毕能事，端扆乐成功。\n运与千龄合，欢将万国同。\n汉酺歌圣酒，韶乐舞薰风。\n河洛荣光遍，云烟喜气通。\n春华顿觉早，天泽倍知崇。\n草木皆沾被，犹言不在躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}